OL,3,GNEWSA'My donated Brummie accent gives
OL,4,Ame confidence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who appealed for help to no
OL,7,Flonger sound like a "character from
OL,8,FStar Wars" says he has found his
OL,9,Fcalling.
OL,11,FChristian Wilson, from Bromsgrove, has
OL,12,Fverbal dyspraxia - a difficulty in
OL,13,Fplacing muscles in the correct position
OL,14,Fto produce speech. He uses
OL,15,Ftext-to-speech software in order to
OL,16,Fcommunicate, but said he wanted to
OL,17,Fsound "like a man from Birmingham".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
