OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1791467769
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'My donated Brummie accent gives
OL,4,Ame confidence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 24-year-old's dream was made
OL,7,Fpossible in 2024 when he selected two
OL,8,Fvoice donors that blended a Birmingham
OL,9,Faccent and a Warwickshire accent, which
OL,10,Fhe hoped would help him sound more like
OL,11,Fhis father.
OL,13,FSince May, Wilson has worked at
OL,14,FWorcestershire County Council as a SEND
OL,15,FPeer Advocate. He said his new dialect
OL,16,Fhad given him "the confidence to voice
OL,17,F[his] opinion".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
